&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 마감 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #000000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2~3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #000000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일전<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #000000\">&nbsp;에 여유있게 장학금 신청을 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #000000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #000000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #000000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 계속자의 경우에도 매학기 장학금을 신청해야 함</span>​</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #000000\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #000000\">2. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #000000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">장학금 종류 :&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #000000; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">농업인 자녀 장학금</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; COLOR: #000000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><s